                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ndikhuelesia chifunguo che bubwami bwe mwikulu, ne siosi siosi nisio okaania khu sibala sikanisibwa mwikulu, lundi siosi siosi nisio ofukiilila khu sibala sifukiililwa mwikulu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
